 "about": "Measured points for watereos.eos_phase_diagram, built by scripts/build_phase_diagram_reference.py from the curated water-property database. Ice Ih: measured or derived H2O melting points from -140 to 400 MPa, at or above the homogeneous nucleation line. Ices III and V: measured melting points of Mishima (2021) and Bridgman (1912) up to 420 MPa. Density maxima: measured or derived H2O rows. T in K, p in MPa."
